## Before Any Lab Checklist

Before starting any cybersecurity lab, I will confirm:

[ ] Is this my own lab machine?
[ ] Is this intentionally vulnerable?
[ ] Do I have written permission?
[ ] Is the scope clear?
[ ] Am I avoiding public/random targets?
[ ] Am I documenting for learning/reporting?
[ ] Am I avoiding real credentials or private data?
